              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwakhe kwaba nguSamgari indodana ka-Anati owabulala kumaFilisti amadoda angamakhulu ayisithupha ngociko lwenkabi; wasindisa no-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
